# Copy to .env (ignored by Git) and run `npm run setup`. The values are copied into
# apps/api/.dev.vars for local development and never printed. Never commit real keys.

# Required for replies, contact generation and images (Meta Model API key).
META_API_KEY=

# Optional: contact voices and spoken replies (docs/voice.md). Uncomment to use it.
# Kept commented because the Deploy to Cloudflare form requires a value for every key
# listed here; add it later as a Worker secret or CI secret instead.
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Optional local ports for `npm run dev:all` (defaults 8787 and 3000).
# API_PORT=8787
# WEB_PORT=3000

# Production does not read this file, except that the Deploy to Cloudflare form asks for
# the uncommented keys. Otherwise set them as CI secrets: docs/infrastructure.md#self-hosting
